    "body": "Now blocked on https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed/issues/1066, but please regard this as a done deal.\r\n\r\n```\r\nDOMTokernList's toggle()/replace() cannot always update the attribute\r\n\r\nThe consistency change made in d396872f847d63b803393092eb81843e80d566b7\r\nturns out to not be compatible with the web.\r\n\r\nTests: https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/issues/6764.\r\n\r\nFixes #451.\r\n```",
